abstract: "A multiplex knowledge graph pipeline extracting, structuring, and analyzing Dutch virology network connections (Fouchier, Koopmans, Erasmus MC) in the COVID-19 lab-origin discourse from Tony's Diary (Fauci, 1,141pp), OpenAlex, and NIH RePORTER. Contains 5,400+ nodes across CO_AUTHOR, POLICY_ADVISORY, and MEDIA_NARRATIVE layers with Louvain community detection and betweenness centrality analysis."
